purpose: AT Protocol/Bluesky API integration and record management
common_tasks:
  - Implementing AT Protocol operations
  - Managing user sessions
  - Creating/updating/deleting records
  - Fetching feeds and timelines
  - Handling authentication flows
  - WebSocket connections for real-time updates
watch_out_for:
  - Use singleton records with rkey "self" for user data
  - Follow com.shadowsky.* collection naming
  - Handle 400 errors (record doesn't exist)
  - Refresh tokens before expiry
  - Rate limiting on API calls
  - CORS issues with media
related_files:
  - /src/contexts/AuthContext.tsx (authentication)
  - /src/services/bookmark-backends/* (AT Protocol storage)
  - /src/services/jetstream-service.ts (WebSocket)
  - @atproto/api (SDK library)
test_command: npm run test:unit
key_patterns:
  - Always check session validity
  - Handle network errors gracefully
  - Use proper DID resolution
  - Implement retry logic
  - Cache API responses